# level1.zmv's way into the first level, then the player stands still until
# frame 3990, turns up, and taps Y: four frames in every twenty from frame
# 4000 to 8400, firing up.
#
# **It is for Dr. Tongue's head** (level 48, under `--level`), which sweeps
# from side to side above the nearest player: with the player held below it
# by `--poke` and a weapon stocked, every shot goes up into it. Most weapons
# fire once a press, so Y is pressed again and again rather than held.
# `tools/code_map_survey.py` runs it.
